                    "customId": "welcome",
                    "content": "<div class=\"ui-welcome\"><h1>Apps and Workflow Made Simple<\/h1><p>&nbsp;<\/p><div class=\"icon\" style=\"margin-right: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; float: left; clear: left\"><img src=\"#request.contextPath#/images/icon_idea.png\" alt=\"Build apps\" width=\"120\" height=\"85\"/><\/div><div class=\"message\"><h3>Build apps, not just processes!<\/h3><p>Create full-fledged apps with support for data records management.<\/p><\/div><p>&nbsp;<\/p><div class=\"icon\" style=\"margin-right: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; float: left; clear: left\"><img src=\"#request.contextPath#/images/icon_rocket.png\" alt=\"Increased efficiency\" width=\"120\" height=\"85\"/><\/div><div class=\"message\"><h3>Increased Efficiency and Productivity<\/h3><p>Faster and more consistent completion of manual processes, and with minimal errors.<\/p><\/div><p>&nbsp;<\/p><div class=\"icon\" style=\"margin-right: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; float: left; clear: left\"><img src=\"#request.contextPath#/images/icon_cost.png\" alt=\"Lowered cost\" width=\"120\" height=\"85\"/><\/div><div class=\"message\"><h3>Lowered Cost<\/h3><p>Employees can be guided through complex procedures, hence reducing the cost of training.<\/p><\/div><\/div>"
